// PURPOSE
// Turn the inventory baseline into a first governance remediation backlog.
// The starter pattern looks for missing ownership or essential naming metadata.
//
// BEFORE RUNNING
// Run 01-agent-inventory.kql first and validate the current AgentsInfo schema.
//
// EXPECTED OUTPUT
// Candidate records requiring ownership/metadata review.
// A query result is a finding candidate, not automatically a governance violation.
//
// NEXT
// Assign an owner/action to each confirmed gap, then continue with
// 03-agent-tools-mcp.kql for tool/MCP discovery.
// Full guide: examples/kql/README.md

AgentsInfo
| where isempty(Owner) or isempty(AgentName)
| project Timestamp, AgentName, AgentId, AgentType, Platform, Owner, Status
| order by Timestamp desc
